{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t海關在荃灣檢獲約4.3公斤懷疑氯胺酮，估計市值約180萬元，拘捕一名男子。<br/>\n<br/>\n海關昨日在荃灣進行緝毒行動，並於一所工業大廈的分間工作室內，檢獲懷疑氯胺酮。海關人員同日在長沙灣拘捕一名40歲懷疑涉案男子。<br/>\n<br/>\n案件仍在調查。被捕男子正保釋侯查，不排除有更多人被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.382686+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T05:08:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T10:17:30.836985+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:19.295285+00:00","content_hash":"97631cfd95bd610beb3e9d16af35963d652767f3b55db8a8548d369d44d76475","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}